<title>USA: Extended Stay Q3 net $0.03/shr, $2.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Extended Stay Q3 net $0.03/shr, $2.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Extended Stay America Inc said that it reported net income for the third quarter of 1996 of $2,300,000 or $0.03 per share.</p>
<p>The company increased its number of operating properties by 167 per cent during the quarter, along with interest income on cash available for future development.</p>
<p>Extended stay began operations in 1995, and completed an initial public offering in December 1995.</p>
